message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Catalogue of a music library (db, 2018)"
version: "1.0"
abstract: "A compact catalogue of the scores and music books of a small music library. Each item records author, title, volume, opus, edition, reviser, section, instruments, condition, cataloguing data, archive location, year and notes, and is entered and searched through a single form."
